  m_text: Here, you can dispatch your ship on expeditions to navigate treacherous
    routes, discover rare resources, and encounter unpredictable events. Every move
    burns fuel and brings new decisions that can either reward you with valuable
    loot or damage your vessel. As you dive into deeper, more dangerous zones, the
    crushing ocean pressure will put your ship's limits to the test. Upgrade your
    hull, manage your supplies carefully, and chart the right path to survive the
    journey and recover the lost vessel pieces.
